    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiplayer Magic Brawler</h2>Manaclysm is a PvP brawler where up to 60 mages wage war across realms fractured by magic.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/ab10778a3ae7e3cb2c06c8d6d678574b.poster.avif?t=1742514064\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/ab10778a3ae7e3cb2c06c8d6d678574b.webm?t=1742514064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/ab10778a3ae7e3cb2c06c8d6d678574b.mp4?t=1742514064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Defeat Opponents, Earn Sparks</h2>Obliterate other mages to earn <strong>Sparks</strong>. Spend them between rounds to enhance your spell arsenal, or max out your <strong>Mana</strong> and lay waste to the whole arena!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/e87369364feb117885dbbe7bdfc9aff9.poster.avif?t=1742514064\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/e87369364feb117885dbbe7bdfc9aff9.webm?t=1742514064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/e87369364feb117885dbbe7bdfc9aff9.mp4?t=1742514064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Counter-spell Combos</h2>Each match features a unique set of spells - combine them in creative ways to counter your adversaries and emerge victorious.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/ec470dc56fddc0081a5ac0c819958ea5.poster.avif?t=1742514064\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/ec470dc56fddc0081a5ac0c819958ea5.webm?t=1742514064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/ec470dc56fddc0081a5ac0c819958ea5.mp4?t=1742514064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Victory</h2>Unleash spell storms, obliterate your opponents, and emerge victorious!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/cb326b19979898965d386002d9f106a1.poster.avif?t=1742514064\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/cb326b19979898965d386002d9f106a1.webm?t=1742514064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/cb326b19979898965d386002d9f106a1.mp4?t=1742514064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">More Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2 - 60 players per match. Invite friends to a private game, or hop into ranked matchmaking for some massive brawls!<br></li><li>Build a new mage with a custom arsenal of spells each match<br></li><li><i>Jump, portal, and fly</i> around the arena while dodging a bullet-hell of arcane projectiles<br></li><li>Easy to pick up, hard to master gameplay<br></li><li>Features custom rollback netcode on dedicated servers. Another player's bad connection won't affect your latency</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiplayer Magic Brawler</h2>Manaclysm is a PvP brawler where up to 60 mages wage war across realms fractured by magic.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/ab10778a3ae7e3cb2c06c8d6d678574b.poster.avif?t=1742514064\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/ab10778a3ae7e3cb2c06c8d6d678574b.webm?t=1742514064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/ab10778a3ae7e3cb2c06c8d6d678574b.mp4?t=1742514064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Defeat Opponents, Earn Sparks</h2>Obliterate other mages to earn <strong>Sparks</strong>. Spend them between rounds to enhance your spell arsenal, or max out your <strong>Mana</strong> and lay waste to the whole arena!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/e87369364feb117885dbbe7bdfc9aff9.poster.avif?t=1742514064\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/e87369364feb117885dbbe7bdfc9aff9.webm?t=1742514064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/e87369364feb117885dbbe7bdfc9aff9.mp4?t=1742514064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Counter-spell Combos</h2>Each match features a unique set of spells - combine them in creative ways to counter your adversaries and emerge victorious.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/ec470dc56fddc0081a5ac0c819958ea5.poster.avif?t=1742514064\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/ec470dc56fddc0081a5ac0c819958ea5.webm?t=1742514064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/ec470dc56fddc0081a5ac0c819958ea5.mp4?t=1742514064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Victory</h2>Unleash spell storms, obliterate your opponents, and emerge victorious!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/cb326b19979898965d386002d9f106a1.poster.avif?t=1742514064\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/cb326b19979898965d386002d9f106a1.webm?t=1742514064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932520/extras/cb326b19979898965d386002d9f106a1.mp4?t=1742514064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">More Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2 - 60 players per match. Invite friends to a private game, or hop into ranked matchmaking for some massive brawls!<br></li><li>Build a new mage with a custom arsenal of spells each match<br></li><li><i>Jump, portal, and fly</i> around the arena while dodging a bullet-hell of arcane projectiles<br></li><li>Easy to pick up, hard to master gameplay<br></li><li>Features custom rollback netcode on dedicated servers. Another player's bad connection won't affect your latency</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Manaclysm is a PvP brawler where up to 60 mages wage war across realms fractured by magic. Slay enemy mages to upgrade your mana and spell arsenal. Invite friends to a private game, or hop into ranked matchmaking for some massive brawls!",
